Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Nested Portlets|
		|testray.main.component.name|Nested Portlets|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: View WCD Nested Portlets
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Nested Portlets Page|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Nested Portlets Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
	And Portlet drag And Drop Portlet To Column PG
		|columnNumberFrom|1|
		|columnNumberTo|2|
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Nested Portlets Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Nested Portlets|
	And NestedPortlets view Configuration Default Layout Template
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Nested Portlets Page|
	And NestedPortlets drag And Drop Portlet To Portlet Column PG
		|columnNumberFrom|2|
		|portletColumnNumberTo|1|
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Nested Portlets Page|
	Then NestedPortlets view PG
		|portletColumnNumberTo|1|
		|portletName|Web Content Display|